# Force LF line endings for text formats this package's own tests and
# reproducibility guarantees depend on being byte-stable across platforms.
# Without this, Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true silently convert
# LF to CRLF on checkout, which fails the conformance goldens' "LF line
# endings, no CR byte" contract (inst/conformance/README.md) even though
# nothing about the data changed.
*.csv text eol=lf
*.nt text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.R text eol=lf
*.Rd text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
